WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.630
B, FaceTime video.

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:17.010
Oh, no.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.100
Hey, B!

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.196
Oh no.

00:00:19.196 --> 00:00:21.530
Well, what's, what's wrong.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.383
Look at that hair.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.910
