swaying inside the cylinder.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:07.143
Yeah. Should we start filming

00:07:07.143 --> 00:07:07.976
down the spout then?

00:07:07.976 --> 00:07:09.630
Yeah, lets start filming down the spout.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.380
We haven't even got it glowing yet.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:16.200
