00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.616
This is like the best angle.

00:07:33.858 --> 00:07:35.358
All right, good.

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:13.861
It's going back down a little bit,

00:08:13.861 --> 00:08:14.694
