00:08:14.694 --> 00:08:16.121
Back down the barrel.

00:08:16.121 --> 00:08:18.240
It used to suck more air in.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:22.193
If we do rev it even
harder, you will get flames,

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.580
that might travel further.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.230
So move back on the
camera and rev it harder?

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.388
Yeah, I think so, I think
your 14 inches might-

