00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.840
I mean, what?

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:23.810
I don't think it'll melt

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.785
I've never got a stainless one to melt

00:13:25.785 --> 00:13:27.770
What is the melting
point of stainless steel?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.307
I think it's 1200 degrees.

00:13:29.307 --> 00:13:30.207
Oh, that is hot.

00:14:43.702 --> 00:14:44.539
Oh, the heat!

00:14:44.539 --> 00:14:46.140
You can't get anywhere near it.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:47.180
It's singeing the table.

