color of the glass as well.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:54.713
Oh yeah.

00:14:54.713 --> 00:14:55.546
It's gone all green.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:57.753
Oh man.

00:14:57.753 --> 00:14:59.130
This is lush as a radiator though.

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.800
Probably wouldn't want to touch that.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:01.960
Oh lovely.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:02.793
Oh, nice.

00:15:02.793 --> 00:15:04.110
Nice, nice in an English winter, right?

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:04.943
Yeah.

00:15:04.943 --> 00:15:06.270
That was some lovely looking footage.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.450
Big thanks to Colin Furze

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:09.510
